BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (nonprevailing party bears that fee; settlement and administrative dispositions require separate reconciliation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Budget dismissed or ineligible matters with no assumed refund until the actual disposition and applicable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (refund rules establish one. This conservative cash treatment prevents a pending refund receivable from) Tj ET
